sales and purchase situation. Interested?","nextNodeIds":[400020203]},{"nodeId":400020203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3578444798,"text":"Sure beats working for free, like last time! Paimon's interested.","nextNodeIds":[400020204]},{"nodeId":400020204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2029,"speakerName":"Huixin","textMapHash":2956376222,"text":"Haha, wonderful! I appreciate the help. Now, let me explain the situation...","nextNodeIds":[400020205]},{"nodeId":400020205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2029,"speakerName":"Huixin","textMapHash":2122197278,"text":"I need two kinds of Plaustrite for official festival use.","nextNodeIds":[400020206]},{"nodeId":400020206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2029,"speakerName":"Huixin","textMapHash":3024979686,"text":"One is called Azurite. It is occasionally found in the northern part of Mt. Tianheng.","nextNodeIds":[400020207]},{"nodeId":400020207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2029,"speakerName":"Huixin","textMapHash":3432983366,"text":"When Azurite gets caught in the roots of ordinary vegetation, it sometimes produces Bloatty Floatties, which have floating seeds.","nextNodeIds":[400020208]},{"nodeId":400020208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2029,"speakerName":"Huixin","textMapHash":1903703230,"text":"The other one is called Vermillionite, which is extremely dangerous as far as most people are concerned...","nextNodeIds":[400020209]},{"nodeId":400020209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2029,"speakerName":"Huixin","textMapHash":3058081374,"text":"In Guili Plains, old Ruin Hunters who have lost the power of flight use Vermillionite to keep themselves airborne.","nextNodeIds":[400020210]},{"nodeId":400020210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":551286350,"text":"Got it! So, Azurite and Vermillionite, right?","nextNodeIds":[400020211]},{"nodeId":400020211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2029,"speakerName":"Huixin","textMapHash":4128149142,"text":"(Actually, they're just blue and red varieties of Plaustrite... Gemstone merchants only gave them fancy names to try and impress their customers...)","nextNodeIds":[400020212]},{"nodeId":400020212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2029,"speakerName":"Huixin","textMapHash":2270407246,"text":"That's right. Please get some of each for me. Good luck!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4000202,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1001","10017"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_ACTIVE_ACTIVITY_COND_STATE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1001","10018"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_ACTIVE_ACTIVITY_COND_STATE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["2029"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":4000203,"order":3,"stepDescription":"Obtain Azurite from Bloatty Floatties","stepDescTextMapHash":2299836574,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[100237,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_OBTAIN_ITEM","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q40002Target3","30"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{